      "patch": "@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+Fix use-after-free crashes in :meth:`bytearray.hex` and :meth:`memoryview.hex`\n+when the separator's :meth:`~object.__len__` mutates the original object.\n+Patch by Bénédikt Tran."
    },
